{"title":"Subjectwise Test-10 Part Syllabus GATE 2026 EC Digital Circuits","fileName":"030_Subjectwise Test-10 Part Syllabus GATE 2026 EC Digital Circuits.html","branch":"ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING","series":"GATE 2026 + GATE 2025 Online Test Series Electronics Engineering","provider":"MADE EASY","duration":5400,"questions":[{"qnum":1,"type":"MCQ","correct":"C","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>Consider the combinational circuit using full adder shown below:</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/580fad7a78590fe0fb267ece4b35870b6700794b.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n<div>where, <em>S</em> and <em>C</em> are sum and carry of full adder.<br />\nThe logic expression for <em>S</em> and <em>C</em> respectively are,</div>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> <img src=\"/media/6616e86255777a5381024df76cfeb64a8b4c6cdd.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> <img src=\"/media/aec54e416d603b425908dc0682064a164d370cfd.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> <img src=\"/media/b006ca9661dd2ad52e8c9e94f4258d935d8696f2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> <img src=\"/media/a90824e2e5134ec62aa39fb8b2c0d4140d679fab.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(c)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/93e6fbff6595efca3eb83c9f69e72b137b3093b6.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":2,"type":"NAT","correct":"","right":1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>The base (<em>x</em>) of the number system for which the below equation holds good is ________.</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/5057d7a7fb74de963fe53faee304cfaca3203f02.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"8","high":"8"},"solution":"<p>8 (8 - 8)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/b9deb6af6209fd0d96efea9abb0139ad4597376a.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","subject":"Technical"},{"